{number: 37}
{title: Christ The Lord Is Risen Today}
{key: C}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[C] Christ the Lord is [F] ris'n to-[C] day, [F] Al-[C] le-[G7] lu-[C] ia!
[F] Sons of men and [C] angels [G] say, [C] Al-[F] le-[G7] lu-[C] ia!
[G] Raise your joys and [C] triumphs [G] high, [C] Al-[F] le-[G7] lu-[C] ia!
[C] Sing, ye heav'ns, and [F] earth re-[C] ply, [F] Al-[C] le-[G7] lu-[C] ia!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[C] Lives a-[F] gain our [C] glorious King, [F] Al-[C] le-[G7] lu-[C] ia!
[F] Where, O death, is [C] now thy [G] sting? [C] Al-[F] le-[G7] lu-[C] ia!
[G] Once He died our [C] souls to [G] save, [C] Al-[F] le-[G7] lu-[C] ia!
[C] Where's thy victo-[F] ry, O [C] grave? [F] Al-[C] le-[G7] lu-[C] ia!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
[C] Love's re-[F] deeming [C] work is done, [F] Al-[C] le-[G7] lu-[C] ia!
[F] Fought the fight, the [C] battle [G] won, [C] Al-[F] le-[G7] lu-[C] ia!
[G] Death in vain for-[C] bids Him [G] rise, [C] Al-[F] le-[G7] lu-[C] ia!
[C] Christ has opened [F] Para-[C] dise, [F] Al-[C] le-[G7] lu-[C] ia!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 4}
[C] Soar we [F] now where [C] Christ has led, [F] Al-[C] le-[G7] lu-[C] ia!
[F] Foll'wing our ex-[C] alted [G] Head, [C] Al-[F] le-[G7] lu-[C] ia!
[G] Made like Him, like [C] Him we [G] rise, [C] Al-[F] le-[G7] lu-[C] ia!
[C] Ours the cross, the [F] grave, the [C] skies, [F] Al-[C] le-[G7] lu-[C] ia!
